{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14819","headline":"和陈翃郎中拜本府少尹兼侍御史献上侍中因呈同院诸公 · 卢纶","name":"和陈翃郎中拜本府少尹兼侍御史献上侍中因呈同院诸公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金印垂鞍白马肥，不同疏广老方归。\n三千士里文章伯，四十年来锦绣衣。\n节比青松当涧直，心随黄雀绕檐飞。\n乡中贺者唯争路，不识传呼獬豸威。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14819.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14819","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}